{"3717700": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Off World Racing", "steam_appid": 3717700, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "controller_support": "full", "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>OFF WORLD RACING</strong></h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >A Science Fiction Racing Adventure</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Race beyond Earth. Master worlds where every race is shaped by gravity, terrain and the unknown. Drive purpose-built exploration vehicles across the Moon, Mars, Europa, Io and Titan in an adventure inspired by science, engineering and humanity's future among the stars.</strong></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Every World Changes the Rules</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Earth taught us how to race.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The Solar System will teach us how to race all over again.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every destination presents its own challenges. Lower gravity changes every jump. Different terrain changes every racing line. Ice, dust, rock and volcanic landscapes demand new driving techniques.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Winning isn't just about speed.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >It's about understanding the world beneath your wheels.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Humanity's Next Motorsport</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >For thousands of years, sport has inspired us to push beyond our limits.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >From ancient foot races to Formula One, competition has always driven innovation, engineering, and human achievement.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Off World Racing imagines the next chapter.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >As humanity expands across the Solar System, motorsport evolves with it.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >New vehicles.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >New worlds.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >New challenges.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >One timeless desire...</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >To see who can master them first.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3717700/extras/3cd12a9c8952c508eb54bbe199f37848.poster.avif?t=1786033302\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3717700/extras/3cd12a9c8952c508eb54bbe199f37848.webm?t=1786033302\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3717700/extras/3cd12a9c8952c508eb54bbe199f37848.mp4?t=1786033302\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Choose Your Style</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Whether you're here for exciting races or authentic driving physics, Off World Racing lets you play your way.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Arcade Mode</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Jump straight into the action.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Accessible.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fast.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Cinematic.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Easy to learn.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Perfect for discovering each incredible world.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Simulation Mode</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every world behaves differently.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Master realistic traction, gravity, and vehicle handling inspired by the environments you're driving across.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Learning the terrain becomes part of becoming a better driver.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Five Incredible Worlds</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Unlike traditional racing games, every location has its own personality.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >🌕 <strong>Moon</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Low gravity.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Huge jumps.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Silent landscapes beneath Earth.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >🔴 <strong>Mars</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Dust storms.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Ancient valleys.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fast-flowing terrain.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >🧊 <strong>Europa</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Frozen plains.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Slippery surfaces.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Jupiter dominating the sky.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >🌋 <strong>Io</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Volcanoes.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Lava.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Unstable landscapes unlike anywhere else.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >🪐 <strong>Titan</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Methane lakes.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Dense atmosphere.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Saturn rising above the horizon.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every world changes how you drive.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Purpose-Built Vehicles</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Drive a growing collection of specialist off-world vehicles designed for exploration, endurance and extreme terrain.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every vehicle has its own strengths, weaknesses and personality.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Choose the machine that best suits both your driving style and the world ahead.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Inspired by Science</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Off World Racing is inspired by real planetary science and engineering.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each world draws inspiration from the characteristics of its real celestial counterpart while delivering fun, rewarding gameplay for players of all skill levels.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You don't need to be a scientist to enjoy it.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Curiosity simply makes the journey even more rewarding.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >More Than Racing</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >• Championships</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >• Time Trials</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >• Obstacle Courses</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >• Challenges</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >• Split-Screen Multiplayer</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >• Steam Leaderboards</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >• Progression System</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >• Unlockable Modes and Tracks</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >• Discover landmarks across every world</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Race Today.</h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Imagine Tomorrow.</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Off World Racing isn't about escaping Earth.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >It's about imagining what humanity might become when the worlds above us become places to explore, work... and race.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The future of motorsport begins beyond Earth.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3717700/extras/0a1245b2fae9a06055f510240bc0768d.avif?t=1786033302\" width=576 height=244 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>", "about_the_game": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>OFF WORLD RACING</strong></h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >A Science Fiction Racing Adventure</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Race beyond Earth. Master worlds where every race is shaped by gravity, terrain and the unknown. Drive purpose-built exploration vehicles across the Moon, Mars, Europa, Io and Titan in an adventure inspired by science, engineering and humanity's future among the stars.</strong></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Every World Changes the Rules</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Earth taught us how to race.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The Solar System will teach us how to race all over again.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every destination presents its own challenges. Lower gravity changes every jump. Different terrain changes every racing line. Ice, dust, rock and volcanic landscapes demand new driving techniques.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Winning isn't just about speed.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >It's about understanding the world beneath your wheels.</p><h2 cl