ired by real planetary science and engineering.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each world draws inspiration from the characteristics of its real celestial counterpart while delivering fun, rewarding gameplay for players of all skill levels.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You don't need to be a scientist to enjoy it.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Curiosity simply makes the journey even more rewarding.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >More Than Racing</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >• Championships</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >• Time Trials</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >• Obstacle Courses</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >• Challenges</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >• Split-Screen Multiplayer</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >• Steam Leaderboards</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >• Progression System</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >• Unlockable Modes and Tracks</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >• Discover landmarks across every world</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Race Today.</h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Imagine Tomorrow.</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Off World Racing isn't about escaping Earth.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >It's about imagining what humanity might become when the worlds above us become places to explore, work... and race.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The future of motorsport begins beyond Earth.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3717700/extras/0a1245b2fae9a06055f510240bc0768d.avif?t=1786033302\" width=576 height=244 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>", "short_description": "Race purpose-built off-world vehicles across the Solar System in a science-fiction racing adventure. Explore five unique worlds where every race is shaped by gravity, terrain, and discovery.", "supported_languages": "English<strong>*</strong>